00:01:08.557 --> 00:01:10.417
"Can you recite the cool girl speech

00:01:10.417 --> 00:01:12.187
"from 'Gone Girl' verbatim?

00:01:12.187 --> 00:01:15.217
"Do you love that one
Jacque Louis David piece,

00:01:15.217 --> 00:01:16.327
"a 'Portrait of a Young Woman in White',

00:01:16.327 --> 00:01:17.827
"not because you care about art,

00:01:17.827 --> 00:01:20.107
"but because you like the
broken female protagonists

00:01:20.107 --> 00:01:22.207
