Vladimir Nabokov's 'Lolita'?

00:01:30.487 --> 00:01:33.127
"Do you enjoy Catholic iconography?

00:01:33.127 --> 00:01:34.387
"Pressed to describe yourself

00:01:34.387 --> 00:01:36.007
"or to have others describe you?

00:01:36.007 --> 00:01:37.627
"Would you be comfortable with adjectives

00:01:37.627 --> 00:01:39.637
"like toxic or manipulative?

00:01:39.637 --> 00:01:40.470
"If the answers
(crowd cheers)

00:01:40.470 --> 00:01:41.646
