00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:06.690
But before we can talk
about what femcel-core is,

00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:08.160
we gotta start with the roots,

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:11.700
which are unfortunately incels.

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:15.240
The word incel, by the way,
stands for involuntary celibate,

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:18.480
AKA someone who cannot
get laid not by choice.

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:21.090
So in 1997, a Canadian woman

00:06:21.090 --> 00:06:23.250
who goes by Alana and nothing else,

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:25.170
she has kept her identity
mostly anonymous,

00:06:25.170 --> 00:06:26.190
she had started dating

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:28.050
and was having trouble with relationships,

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:29.430
so she started this website

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:32.790
called Alana's Involuntary
Celibate Project

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:35.010
for anyone else who was also struggling

00:06:35.010 --> 00:06:37.170
with the romance department.

00:06:37.170 --> 00:06:39.810
It was a simple website
where she posted articles,

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:42.900
ran a mailing list, and
then evolved into a forum

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:45.090
where people would talk
about being lonely.

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:47.197
Alana says, "There was
probably a bit of anger

00:06:47.197 --> 00:06:48.697
"and some men were a bit clueless

00:06:48.697 --> 00:06:51.157
"about how women are
unique individual humans,

00:06:51.157 --> 00:06:52.320
"but in general it was a supportive place.

00:06:52.320 --> 00:06:55.987
"The word incel used to
mean anybody of any gender

00:06:55.987 --> 00:06:57.937
"who was lonely, had never had sex,

00:06:57.937 --> 00:07:00.240
"or who hadn't had a
relationship in a long time."

00:07:00.240 --> 00:07:04.770
Fast forward to 2014, a
22-year-old man named Elliot Rodger

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:06.660
went on a shooting and stabbing spree

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:09.720
in Isla Vista, California,
killing six people

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:12.480
and injuring 14 before offing himself.

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:14.070
It was revealed that before his death

00:07:14.070 --> 00:07:17.940
he had distributed a 141 page document

00:07:17.940 --> 00:07:21.090
about his hatred towards women

00:07:21.090 --> 00:07:23.850
that was caused by his intense frustration

00:07:23.850 --> 00:07:25.350
of being a virgin.

00:07:25.350 --> 00:07:28.680
And then in 2018,
25-year-old Alec Minassian

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:31.410
drove his van into a
crowded sidewalk in Toronto,

00:07:31.410 --> 00:07:34.080
killing 10 people and injuring 16.

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:35.970
After the attack, he told investigators

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:39.180
that he was an incel and that his actions

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:44.100
were a revenge plot over him
not being able to get laid.

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:47.250
The incel community has thus developed

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:51.150
in the worst way possible from
being a fringe internet group

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:55.230
to a recognized terrorist threat.

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:57.060
So we compare them to femcels.

00:07:57.060 --> 00:08:00.540
The only real shared thing is their belief

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:03.120
that they cannot have sex

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:05.190
or cannot get into romantic relationships

00:08:05.190 --> 00:08:07.470
because of their looks or personality.

00:08:07.470 --> 00:08:09.030
And even though a lot of
people feel this type of way,

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:13.500
at least during one point in
their lives, femcels believe

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:15.990
there's something
significantly wrong with them

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:19.500
that makes them different
from other women.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:22.140
According to the now
defunct Reddit thread,

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:24.037
trufemcels, "to be a femcel,

00:08:24.037 --> 00:08:26.887
"you have to have defects that must exceed

00:08:26.887 --> 00:08:28.117
"those of normal women

00:08:28.117 --> 00:08:31.260
"and exist in a much more severe form."

00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:32.797
As MEL Magazine puts it,

00:08:32.797 --> 00:08:35.617
"Femcels were dealt a shitty
hand, the sentiment goes,

00:08:35.617 --> 00:08:38.077
"and the only way out of the
lonely hellscapes they live in

00:08:38.077 --> 00:08:41.520
"is to ascend, femcel
speak for get hotter."

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:44.460
Since the Reddit thread has been banned,

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:46.980
it's difficult to mine it for content

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:50.190
unless you know how to use
internet archive tools,

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:51.780
but from articles that I've read,

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:54.930
it sounds like unlike incel forms,

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:57.240
femcels are nonviolent for the most part.

00:08:57.240 --> 00:08:59.040
Like there might be some fringe person

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:02.520
who's writing something truly disturbing,

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:04.830
but for the most part, most of the content

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:09.780
