unhappiness with themselves.

00:09:09.780 --> 00:09:10.950
And unfortunately this rhetoric

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:14.400
is actually how most women tend to feel

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:17.490
when navigating romantic spheres.

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:20.430
Tracy Moore did an
investigation on nice girls

00:09:20.430 --> 00:09:25.110
and found that women, most women
who blame their lack of sex

00:09:25.110 --> 00:09:27.390
or relationships on their appearance

00:09:27.390 --> 00:09:30.450
actually feel embarrassed or sorry

00:09:30.450 --> 00:09:34.320
