that they find attractive.

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:36.720
That's not to say that there
are absolutely no problems

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:38.370
in the femcel community, though.

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:40.890
Lorelei Alverson researched femcel forums

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:42.487
and found that, "Despite several members

00:09:42.487 --> 00:09:44.197
"identifying as people of color,

00:09:44.197 --> 00:09:46.897
"the vast majority of
users across femcel forums

00:09:46.897 --> 00:09:49.890
"are white and leveraged
this whiteness in disputes."

00:09:49.890 --> 00:09:52.200
There are also a lot
of transphobic femcels

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:54.360
who express anger towards trans women

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:57.630
who are able to get facial
feminization surgery

00:09:57.630 --> 00:09:59.400
covered by their health insurance.

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:04.400
And I think even people who
are not outwardly transphobic,

00:10:04.590 --> 00:10:07.782
the lingo that's used among femcels,

00:10:07.782 --> 00:10:10.320
like femcels speak and the
assumptions that they have

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:14.610
about women tend to fall into
this gender essentialist,

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:18.840
like there are only two genders mindset,

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:21.090
which ends up becoming a breeding ground

00:10:21.090 --> 00:10:23.640
for transphobic trains of thought.

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:25.320
So what I just described to you all

00:10:25.320 --> 00:10:28.230
